+     *     type 9:    reg[[0x401A88]] = [0x40186C]     ; write a register
+     *     type 6/7:  call [0x401A88]([0x40186C])      ; run a callback
+     *
+     * in step with the pushbuffer. The aperture is plain memory, so unless
